WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.180
You can’t hold me here forever!

2
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.121
Tristay: You’re right.

3
00:00:15.761 --> 00:00:17.442
I need something else to hold you.

4
00:00:17.462 --> 00:00:19.263
Tristay: Drag him to the post!

5
00:00:19.763 --> 00:00:22.664
Now! Hold his hands together!

6
00:00:22.684 --> 00:00:28.467
Hopian: What is that?

7
00:00:28.487 --> 00:00:31.388
Tristay: It’s something to hold you tight.

8
00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.165
Hopian: The rope is so cold!

9
00:00:39.185 --> 00:00:45.431
Tristay: Watch me prepare something special for those troublesome kids.

10
00:00:45.451 --> 00:00:49.014
Tristay: But first I need to increase my power.

11
00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:00.143
They’re so beautiful Tristay: I think so too.

12
00:01:00.844 --> 00:01:02.985
They will help me stop those kids.

13
00:01:03.005 --> 00:01:05.608
Hopian: What are you going to do?

14
00:01:06.804 --> 00:01:07.404
Tristay: You’ll see.

15
00:01:07.424 --> 00:01:15.846
Tristay: You will fly high from this mountaintop.

16
00:01:16.447 --> 00:01:17.947
You will attack from the air.

17
00:01:17.967 --> 00:01:20.868
Hopian: Good.

18
00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:22.168
He’s busy.

19
00:01:22.788 --> 00:01:24.249
I’ve got to warn the kids.

20
00:01:26.549 --> 00:01:33.291
Hopian: If only I could reach my hat It’s no use.

21
00:01:33.311 --> 00:01:35.852
Hopian: This rope is too strong.

22
00:01:37.228 --> 00:01:40.131
Hopian: Wait a minute, what did I tell Danny?

23
00:01:41.212 --> 00:01:42.893
Use your imagination.

24
00:01:42.913 --> 00:01:46.717
Hopian: Come to me, my little friend.

25
00:01:47.477 --> 00:01:48.338
Come to me.

26
00:01:48.358 --> 00:01:54.504
Hopian: Good bug!

27
00:01:55.304 --> 00:01:56.085
Now hurry.

28
00:01:56.686 --> 00:01:59.008
You must find Danny and warn him!

29
00:02:08.548 --> 00:02:09.648
Tristay: Isn’t it beautiful?

30
00:02:09.668 --> 00:02:11.069
Hopian: No.

31
00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:13.489
Tristay: I think it is.

32
00:02:13.509 --> 00:02:17.671
Tirstay: And it will be even more beautiful when it eats those kids!

33
00:02:17.691 --> 00:02:28.274
Danny: Now that we’ve restored color to the water, [n3@we’re one step closer to defeating Tristay.

34
00:02:28.294 --> 00:02:29.994
Tina: What’s next?

35
00:02:30.014 --> 00:02:31.394
Brad: The flowers.

36
00:02:31.795 --> 00:02:33.315
We need to make them red again.

37
00:02:33.335 --> 00:02:36.436
Tina: There were flowers in Hopian’s garden.

38
00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.341
We could start with those.

39
00:02:38.361 --> 00:02:39.982
Danny: Great idea!

40
00:02:40.002 --> 00:02:44.125
Tina: It should be easy now that those evil creatures are all gone.

41
00:02:44.145 --> 00:02:47.947
Brad: I hope there are no other evil things waiting for us.

42
00:02:55.212 --> 00:03:00.836
Wow. This would look so pretty except Brad: Except that it’s so gray.

43
00:03:00.856 --> 00:03:02.237
Bello: Gray.

44
00:03:02.257 --> 00:03:06.980
Danny: But once we put the color back, it’s going to look fantastic!

45
00:03:08.929 --> 00:03:14.374
Hmm Brad: I don’t think throwing the clay on the flowers will work.

46
00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:15.555
Tina: No.

47
00:03:15.575 --> 00:03:19.779
Danny: How are we going to make the flowers red?
